# REQUIRES: python-api, torch, parmed
# The derivative in the positions through mdir.torch with the extra points
# of Amber (D385, D384, D387, #771), on the CPU:
# OPC from a prmtop cut by ParmEd (with the interpreter of the tests, which
# has it), every form of the backward, grad(L, x) among them, against
# FrameEnergies.vjp.
#
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_frame_sites.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide cut CPU Double %t
# RUN: %torch_python %S/Inputs/python_frame_hvp_torch.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide amber CPU Double %t | FileCheck %s -DMODE="CPU Double torch"
# RUN: %torch_python %S/Inputs/python_frame_hvp_torch.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide amber CPU Mixed %t | FileCheck %s -DMODE="CPU Mixed torch"

# CHECK: [[MODE]]: Amber OPC (ACE-ALA-NME and 40 waters), 2 frames: every form, with and without a term of the energy, against FrameEnergies.vjp: theta to the bit, x {{[0-9.e+-]+}} of the largest entry (tolerance {{[0-9e+-]+}}); one pass of each product that the form takes
